Build an interactive figure using SVG.js.

CONCEPT: BUILD-MAX-HEAP turns an arbitrary array into a max-heap in place by calling MAX-HEAPIFY on every internal node from index ⌊n/2⌋ down to 1, so that each sift-down operates on subtrees whose children are already valid heaps.
KEY INSIGHT (what students should walk away understanding): MAX-HEAPIFY can only fix a node whose two subtrees are already heaps — so BUILD-MAX-HEAP runs the loop backwards from ⌊n/2⌋ to 1, guaranteeing that precondition for free at every call.
DEMO STEPS: 6 guided steps — implement the step player in #ui

FULL BLUEPRINT:
{
