<textarea id="heapifyEditorCode" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
<span style="display:block;font-size:10px;color:#666;line-height:1.4">API (all 1-based): <b>value(i)</b>, <b>left(i)</b>, <b>right(i)</b>, <b>greater(i,j)</b>, <b>swap(i,j)</b>, <b>mark(i,text)</b>. Only <b>swap</b> may mutate A; every call records one animation frame.</span>
